<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AdjectiveObject</title>
    <!-- The style.css file allows you to change the look of your web pages.
         If you include the next line in all your web pages, they will all share the same look.
         This makes it easier to make new pages for your site. -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="Media/heartbrowser.ico">
    <link href="Style/CSS/simple.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link href="Style/CSS/cursor.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="all">
    <style>

    </style>
  </head>
  <body id="body">
    
  <h1 id="Title">Warning!</h1>
  
  <p>This website by default contains a lot of flickering and flashing lights. If that's going to affect you, there's a no flickering version to look at instead! Keep yourself safe! &lt;3</p>
  <p>(it's also designed for desktop. i probably do not recommend trying to navigate on mobile)</p>
  
  <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" onclick="window.location = `home.html`"><span>Continue</span></button>
  <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" onclick="window.location = `NonFlashing/home.html`"><span>Non Flashing</span></button>
   
  <script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/3.7.1/jquery.min.js"></script>
  <script type="text/javascript" src="Style/JS/cursor.js"></script>
  <script>
    function redirect() {
      window.location = `home.html`;
    }
  </script>
  </body>
</html>
